  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/heygen-com/hyperframes/zipball/v0.9.15",
  "body": "# HyperFrames v0.9.15\n\nReleased on 2026-11-05.\n\nLocal renders on FFmpeg 4 no longer turn a finished mix down by several dB when they match its length to the video. Motion blur can now choose when its shutter opens.\n\n## Features\n\n- **Core:** `data-motion-blur-phase` sets when the motion-blur shutter opens in each frame ([aace91b](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/aace91b5ec0d937772f66ab06e63c5755e579646), [#6983](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/6983)).\n\n## Fixes\n\n- **Render:** On FFmpeg 4, a mix already under the peak limit is no longer turned down by several dB when its length is matched to the video. Two near-identical mixes no longer land about 4 LU apart ([f6ae9bf](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/commit/f6ae9bfb43a4e4bee0d132a5ac2a0b1ce4bf383f), [#7199](https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/pull/7199)).\n\n## Full changelog\n\nhttps://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes/compare/v0.9.14...v0.9.15\n"
}
